          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UManowa wayesethatha izinyane lembuzi nomnikelo womlilo, wanikela ngawo kuJehova edwaleni; ingelosi yenza ngokumangalisayo; uManowa nomkakhe babheka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.19",
